  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening conservation of critically endangered leatherback and hawksbill marine turtles on Nicaragua&apos;s Pacific Coast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will 1. monitor and evaluate beach and nest temperatures in hatcheries and on nesting beach, 2. evaluate and compare hatchling sex ratios in hatcheries and in situ nests, 3. evaluate predation of hatchlings from arribada nesting and solitary nesting, 4. evaluate type and abundance of predators at Rancho Nuevo nesting beach, 5. evaluate emergence rate and survival rate to sea of hatchlings from arribada nests and solitary nests, and 6. evaluate hatchling emergence times in hatcheries and in situ.</narrative>
  </description>
